ach task-scoped fixture manifest commands and results"}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-1gvdtz","updated":true}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-1gvdtz","item":1,"text":"Execute staged concurrency large-transfer rekey pressure and cancellation rows"}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-1gvdtz","item":2,"text":"Capture integrity throughput memory queue channel and cleanup evidence"}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-1gvdtz","item":3,"text":"Attach task-scoped matrix configuration and results"}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-2voayq","updated":true}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-2voayq","item":1,"text":"Document the implemented TCP path with focused component and sequence diagrams"}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-2voayq","item":2,"text":"Verify limits errors privacy and reproduction commands against evidence"}},{"ok":true,"result":{"id":"TASK-260715-2voayq","item":3,"text":"Attach task-scoped documentation and review evidence"}}]

