 the M1 decomposition\"); add_resource(TASK-260715-30ugfm, name=TASK-260715-30ugfm_safe-startup-sequence.puml, content=\"@startuml\\n"'!theme plain'"\\ntitle M1 leak-safe provider startup and mandatory-failure ordering\\nactor \\\"Containing app\\\" as App\\nparticipant \\\"Packet-tunnel provider\\\" as Provider\\nparticipant \\\"Profile and Keychain boundary\\\" as Profile\\nparticipant \\\"SSH bootstrap\\\" as SSH\\nparticipant \\\"Packet plane and private TCP adapter\\\" as Packet\\nparticipant \\\"Tunnel DNS over SSH TCP\\\" as DNS\\nparticipant \\\"Network Extension settings\\\" as NE\\nparticipant \\\"Packet flow\\\" as Flow\\n\\nApp -> Provider: Start with opaque profile reference\\nProvider -> Profile: Load non-secret snapshot and credential references\\nProfile --> Provider: Validated generation\\nProvider -> SSH: Resolve on physical path, connect, verify host, authenticate\\nSSH --> Provider: Verified session plus actual endpoint\\nProvider -> Packet: Prepare bridge, HEV, private SOCKS, TCP admission\\nPacket --> Provider: Ready without packet reads\\nProvider -> DNS: Prepare virtual UDP and TCP listener plus SSH DNS-over-TCP\\nDNS --> Provider: Safe DNS ready, no physical fallback\\nProvider -> NE: Apply IPv4 and IPv6 defaults, tunnel DNS, exact SSH host exclusion\\nNE --> Provider: Settings applied\\nProvider -> Flow: Start packet reads\\nFlow --> Provider: Read loop active\\nProvider --> App: Versioned TCP and safe-DNS capability snapshot\\n\\nnote over Provider,Flow\\nThe provider owns all live state.\\nApp suspension or termination does not stop forwarding.\\nend note\\n\\nalt Mandatory failure before settings apply\\n  Provider -> DNS: Cancel if acquired\\n  Provider -> Packet: Cancel and release if acquired\\n  Provider -> SSH: Close session if acquired\\n  Provider --> App: Failed with no tunnel routes installed\\nelse Mandatory failure after settings apply\\n  Provider -> Flow: Stop reads and new flows\\n  Provider -> DNS: Stop transactions without physical fallback\\n  Provider -> Packet: Cancel flows and release packet plane\\n  Provider -> SSH: Close session\\n  Provider -> NE: Remove or invalidate tunnel settings through provider stop\\n  Provider --> App: Capability revoked, then explicit failure\\nend\\n@enduml\", type=outcome, description=\"Task-scoped PlantUML sequence for leak-safe M1 startup, UI independence, rollback, and stop\"); add_resource(EPIC-260715-3810we, name=EPIC-260715-3810we_diagram-validation-01.log, content=\"Command: task-board plan EPIC-260715-3810we --render --layout phases --format png\\nResult: rendering unavailable in the current environment. Graphviz dot aborted because /opt/homebrew/opt/libtool/lib/libltdl.7.dylib is missing.\\nDisposition: no PNG is claimed. The canonical plan and two readable diagrams-as-code are attached. This is a workstation toolchain anomaly, not a plan or product blocker.\", type=outcome, description=\"Graphviz render-validation environment anomaly and disposition\")'" in /Users/iv/Developer/relux-proxy
