## Gap closure and deliberate boundaries

- TASK-260715-1tnjlu is the only immediately unblocked M1 task. It resolves whether resolver selection is explicit per profile, a documented default, exit-host discovery, or tunneled DoH. DNS code is blocked until an accountable policy and schema decision exists.
